{
  "_readme": [
    "Flashcard pictures. Two faces per card, both downloaded + cached on first view (NOT bundled):",
    "  • 'cartoons'  — the illustrated face, shown first.",
    "  • 'overrides' — the realistic photograph, revealed by tap-to-flip.",
    "Parsed by lib/core/services/flashcard_photo_service.dart; rendered by lib/widgets/flashcard_image.dart.",
    "",
    "A card flips only when BOTH faces exist. Colors & Shapes and Numbers are realistic-only on",
    "purpose (a photo of the colour/quantity is the lesson), so they render the photo with no flip.",
    "A card with neither face falls back to its emoji — see lib/core/constants/flashcard_emojis.dart.",
    "",
    "Direct URLs are used throughout; share-page links (postimg.cc/<id>) still resolve via",
    "lib/core/services/media_url_resolver.dart if you ever paste one.",
    "",
    "Resolution order for a card's realistic photo:",
    "  1. overrides['<Category label>__<english word lowercased>']  (used below), else",
    "  2. <base_url>/<Category label>/<English word>.<ext>  (only if base_url is set).",
    "'cartoons' is override-only — there is no base_url pattern for it.",
    "",
    "GALLERIES (extra examples): 'galleries' maps the same key to a LIST of extra photo URLs.",
    "The Examples button (viewer) then shows the main photo + these extras in a swipeable gallery.",
    "",
    "Category labels: Animals, Colors & Shapes, Numbers, Body Parts, Food & Drinks, Family & Greetings,",
    "Clothing, Weather, Classroom, Transportation, Emotions, Days & Time, Actions."
  ],
